@param canvas_url: L'URL dell'istanza Canvas.
@return: Un elenco dei corsi presenti in quell'istanza Canvas.

Italian.back_translation:
Use the Canvas API to obtain all courses in a Canvas instance.  
@param canvas_url: The URL of the Canvas instance.  
@return: A list of the courses available in that Canvas instance.

Afrikaans.translation:
Gebruik die Canvas API om al die kursusse in 'n Canvas-instantie te verkry.
@param canvas_url: Die URL van die Canvas-instantie.
@return: 'n Lys van kursusse op daardie Canvas-instantie.

Afrikaans.back_translation:
